<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?><tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" itunes:timing="Word"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"><ttm:name type="full">當山みれい</ttm:name></ttm:agent><iTunesMetadata xmlns="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal"><songwriters></songwriters><translations><translation type="subtitle" xml:lang="zh-Hans"><text for="L1">为什么要向我搭话呢？为什么偏偏是我呢</text><text for="L2">明明酒杯与交谈声在此交织重叠</text><text for="L3">“休息日一般怎么过呢？”</text><text for="L4">“看电影？我也很喜欢哦”</text><text for="L5">本该是很简单的Questions 我却找不到答案</text><text for="L6">请转过身来 但暂时先别靠近我</text><text for="L7">我也不是没有在期待</text><text for="L8">虽然还不清楚你的心意 但好想听你说</text><text for="L9">听你对我说一句“好可爱”</text><text for="L10">想要更了解你</text><text for="L11">却不想向你展露我的心声</text><text for="L12">唯独看不透你的心意</text><text for="L13">怦然跳动的 Heartbeat</text><text for="L14">宝贝 你能让我知道吗</text><text for="L15">也许我想听你说我“好可爱”</text><text for="L16">你突然一言不发地来到我身旁</text><text for="L17">害我连口红和刘海都来不及整理…。</text><text for="L18">“你没有男朋友吗？空窗期多久了？”</text><text for="L19">“你喜欢什么类型的？”</text><text for="L20">再这样让我小鹿乱撞下去，可不行哦</text><text for="L21">请转过身来 但暂时先别靠近我</text><text for="L22">仿佛一切都要被你看穿</text><text for="L23">虽然还不清楚 但好想听你说</text><text for="L24">听你对我说一句“好可爱”</text><text for="L25">想要更了解你</text><text for="L26">却不想向你展露我的心声</text><text for="L27">唯独看不透你的心意</text><text for="L28">怦然跳动的 Heartbeat</text><text for="L29">宝贝 你能让我知道吗</text><text for="L30">好想听你说我“好可爱”</text><text for="L31">“时间差不多了呢”</text><text for="L32">“待会打算怎么办？要回家吗？”</text><text for="L33">如果在这里说再见 是不是就再也见不到你了？</text><text for="L34">请转过身来 但暂时先别靠近我</text><text for="L35">越来越快的心意 已无法抑制</text><text for="L36">其实我好想全部都告诉你</text><text for="L37">告诉你“我还想再见到你”</text><text for="L38">想要更了解你</text><text for="L39">却不想向你展露我的心声</text><text for="L40">唯独看不透你的心意</text><text for="L41">怦然跳动的 Heartbeat</text><text for="L42">宝贝 你能让我知道吗</text><text for="L43">好想听你说我“好可爱”</text></translation></translations></iTunesMetadata></metadata></head><body><div itunes:song-part="Verse"><p begin="0:18.260" end="0:26.180" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:18.260" end="0:18.400">ど</span><span begin="0:18.400" end="0:18.730">う</span><span begin="0:18.730" end="0:20.090">し</span><span begin="0:20.090" end="0:21.020">て</span><span begin="0:21.020" end="0:21.620">声</span><span begin="0:21.620" end="0:21.790">か</span><span begin="0:21.790" end="0:22.080">け</span><span begin="0:22.080" end="0:22.270">て</span><span begin="0:22.270" end="0:22.620">く</span><span begin="0:22.620" end="0:23.080">る</span><span begin="0:23.080" end="0:23.510">の</span><span begin="0:23.510" end="0:24.010">？</span>　<span begin="0:24.010" end="0:24.230">な</span><span begin="0:24.230" end="0:24.360">ん</span><span begin="0:24.360" end="0:24.590">で</span><span begin="0:24.590" end="0:25.300">私</span><span begin="0:25.300" end="0:25.730">な</span><span begin="0:25.730" end="0:26.180">の</span></p><p begin="0:26.180" end="0:34.080" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:26.180" end="0:26.330">グ</span><span begin="0:26.330" end="0:26.700">ラ</span><span begin="0:26.700" end="0:28.040">ス</span><span begin="0:28.040" end="0:29.020">も</span><span begin="0:29.020" end="0:29.580">会</span><span begin="0:29.580" end="0:29.820">話</span><span begin="0:29.820" end="0:30.070">も</span><span begin="0:30.070" end="0:30.280">こ</span><span begin="0:30.280" end="0:30.730">ん</span><span begin="0:30.730" end="0:31.090">な</span><span begin="0:31.090" end="0:32.030">に</span><span begin="0:32.030" end="0:32.620">並</span><span begin="0:32.620" end="0:32.830">ん</span><span begin="0:32.830" end="0:33.100">で</span><span begin="0:33.100" end="0:33.290">る</span><span begin="0:33.290" end="0:33.740">の</span><span begin="0:33.740" end="0:34.080">に</span></p><p begin="0:34.080" end="0:38.060" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0: